Required Disclosure

Commercial materials should identify:

* which repository content they derive from;
* what additional service is being sold;
* whether professional review is included;
* what remains experimental;
* and what the purchase does not certify.

Principle

Commercial availability does not prove:

* scholarly validity;
* legal compliance;
* technical security;
* institutional adoption;
* or operational readiness.

