RQ225 — Expanding the Research in the Book

Research Question

How should the book expand the research without overstating findings?

Short Title

Responsible Book Expansion

Permitted Expansion

The book may add:

* historical context;
* explanatory examples;
* implementation scenarios;
* clearly labeled interpretation;
* case narratives;
* diagrams;
* ethical reflection;
* and future research directions.

Required Safeguards

The book should:

* preserve evidence labels;
* cite canonical files;
* identify unresolved issues;
* distinguish proposed standards from law;
* separate theology from empirical findings;
* identify hypothetical cases;
* and avoid claiming universal adoption.

